// Badhan's logo, downscaled from src/assets/images/badhanlogo.png (614x614, 230 KB) to 300x298
// — about 25 mm wide at 300 DPI, which is the size it prints at on the certificate.
//
// Held as a base64 data URI rather than imported as an asset so that the certificate SVG is fully
// self-contained. Phase 4 converts that same SVG into a PDF, and an <image> pointing at an
// emitted file URL would have to be fetched at conversion time; a data URI is already there.
//
// Raster is acceptable here and only here: a slightly soft logo is invisible to a reader, while a
// slightly soft QR code stops scanning, which is why the QR is drawn as vector. Regenerate with:
//   sips -Z 300 src/assets/images/badhanlogo.png --out /tmp/logo.png

export const CERTIFICATE_LOGO_DATA_URI =
  'data:image/png;base64,'
